efault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-03-09T14:53:31Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T13:50:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5dev\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11800H NVIDIA RTX3050\n\n### Issue description\n\n<del>The Popup control should not be a window control.\nIn Godot, the Popup control class is the subclass of the Window class. So sometimes the Popup's behavior is more like a window, not the true Popup.</del>\nIn Godot, Popup controls' behavior is more like normal windows, instead of normal popups.\nLook at these examples.\n1. Dropdown a Popup menu. Click the position out of the Popup menu. You can't focus a new control.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c151cdd1-75ec-4611-98df-fdac457507dc)\n\n2. Dropdown a Popup menu. Scroll the panel. Popup menu will leave the parent control.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/40c438a9-550b-43a8-9256-5f396cfb4288)\n\n3. The rename box in the SceneTree is achieved by using LineEdit and Popup. So it has the same bug. The bug has been reported by #103628\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a56c1ace-f0f4-4009-b293-0671da20d90a)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b53b7dd1-22da-4d36-b7f8-a90d00c3ed8d)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nFollow Gifs\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103861/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}